# Local secrets — a pasted VITE_LIVE_BLOCK_TOKEN spends REAL Buzz; never commit it.
# `civitai app dev-token <slug> --env >> .env.development.local` writes here.
# .env.development / .env.example / .env.production ARE tracked. As scaffolded
# they hold only non-secret VITE_ values — that is a fact about the files you
# were given, not a property git or the CLI enforces about the ones you edit.
# `civitai app submit` UPLOADS .env.example and .env.production verbatim (it
# excludes .env.development), so keep secrets out of all three.
.env.local
.env.*.local
